385	\N	\N	2026-11-22 17:49:20.983244	1	https://www.odoo.com/app/manufacturing	{"en_US": "Analytic accounting in Manufacturing", "es_ES": "Contabilidad analítica en fabricación"}	mrp_account	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Accounting - MRP", "es_ES": "Contabilidad - MRP"}	57	{"en_US": "\\nAnalytic Accounting in MRP\\n==========================\\n\\n* Cost structure report\\n\\nAlso, allows to compute the cost of the product based on its BoM, using the costs of its components and work center operations.\\nIt adds a button on the product itself but also an action in the list view of the products.\\nIf the automated inventory valuation is active, the necessary accounting entries will be created.\\n\\n", "es_ES": "\\nContabilidad analítica en MRP\\n==========================\\n\\n* Informe de estructura de costes\\n\\nAdemás, permite calcular el coste del producto en función de su LdM con los costes de sus componentes y las operaciones del centro de trabajo.\\nAñade un botón en el producto, pero también una acción en la vista de lista de los productos.\\nSi la valuación automatizada del inventario está activa, se crearán los asientos contables necesarios.\\n\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N		WIP report	* INHERIT account.analytic.account.form.mrp (form)\n* INHERIT account.move.inherit.mrp.account (form)\n* INHERIT mrp.production.graph.inherited.mrp.account (graph)\n* INHERIT mrp.production.view.inherited (form)\n* INHERIT mrp.workcenter.form.inherit (form)\n* INHERIT product.product.product.view.form.easy.bom.inherit (form)\n* INHERIT product.product.view.form.normal.inherit.extended (form)\n* INHERIT product_extended.product.form.view (form)\nPost WIP Accounting Entry (form)\nmrp_account.report_wip (qweb)	official	\N
