80	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "Assist with automatic completion & suggestions when filling address", "es_ES": "Ayude a completar el campo de dirección con el completado automático y sugerencias."}	google_address_autocomplete	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Google Address Autocomplete", "es_ES": "Autocompletado de la dirección de Google"}	5	{"en_US": "\\nThis module Auto complete the address data.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste módulo autocompleta los datos de la dirección.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT res.company.form.inherit.address.autocomplete (form)\n* INHERIT res.config.settings.view.form.inherit.website (form)\n* INHERIT view.partner.address.form.inherit.address.autocomplete (form)\n* INHERIT view.partner.form.inherit.address.autocomplete (form)	official	\N
