5	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": ""}	account_edi	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Import/Export Invoices From XML/PDF", "es_ES": "Importar/Exportar facturas desde XML/PDF"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nElectronic Data Interchange\\n=======================================\\nEDI is the electronic interchange of business information using a standardized format.\\n\\nThis is the base module for import and export of invoices in various EDI formats, and the\\nthe transmission of said documents to various parties involved in the exchange (other company,\\ngovernements, etc.)\\n", "es_ES": "\\nIntercambio electrónico de datos\\n=======================================\\nEDI es el intercambio electrónico de información empresarial mediante un formato estandarizado.\\n\\nEste es el módulo base para la importación y exportación de facturas en varios formatos EDI, y la\\ntransmisión de dichos documentos a las diversas partes involucradas en el intercambio (otra empresa,\\ngobiernos, etc.)\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
24	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "Log in with a Passkey", "es_ES": "Iniciar sesión con clave de acceso"}	auth_passkey	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.1	{"en_US": "Passkeys", "es_ES": "Claves de acceso"}	5	{"en_US": "\\nThe implementation of Passkeys using the webauthn protocol.\\n===========================================================\\n\\nPasskeys are a secure alternative to a username and a password.\\nWhen a user logs in with a Passkey, MFA will not be required.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nImplementación de claves de acceso usando el protocolo webauthn.\\n===========================================================\\n\\nLas claves son una alternativa segura para nombres de usuario y contraseñas.\\nCuando un usuario inicia sesión con una contraseña, no se le pedirá MFA.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT Passkey Login OAuth (qweb)\n* INHERIT auth.passkey.users.form (form)\n* INHERIT auth.passkey.users.preferences (form)\n* INHERIT auth_passkey_login (qweb)\n* INHERIT res.users.identitycheck form (form)\nCreate Passkey Wizard Form (form)\nauth.passkey.key.kanban (kanban)\nauth.passkey.key.rename (form)	official	\N
6	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": ""}	account_edi_proxy_client	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Proxy features for account_edi", "es_ES": "Características proxy para account_edi"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nThis module adds generic features to register an Odoo DB on the proxy responsible for receiving data (via requests from web-services).\\n- An edi_proxy_user has a unique identification on a specific proxy type (e.g. l10n_it_edi, peppol) which\\nallows to identify him when receiving a document addressed to him. It is linked to a specific company on a specific\\nOdoo database.\\n- Encryption features allows to decrypt all the user's data when receiving it from the proxy.\\n- Authentication offers an additionnal level of security to avoid impersonification, in case someone gains to the user's database.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste módulo añade características genéricas para registrar una base de datos de Odoo en el proxy responsable de recibir la información (por medio de peticiones de servicios web).\\n- Un edi_proxy_user tiene una identificación única en un tipo específico de proxy (por ejemplo, l10n_it_edi, peppol) que \\npermite identificarlo al recibir un documento que se dirige a él. Se vincula con una empresa específica en una base\\nde datos de Odoo.\\n- Las características de cifrado permiten decodificar toda la información del usuario al recibirlo de un proxy.\\n- La autenticación ofrece un nivel adicional de seguridad para evitar la personificación en caso de que alguien obtenga acceso a la base de datos de un usuario.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Invoicing/Configuration/Invoicing/EDI Proxy Users		EDI Proxy User (form)\nEDI Proxy Users (list)	official	\N
19	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": ""}	analytic	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.2	{"en_US": "Analytic Accounting", "es_ES": "Contabilidad analítica"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nModule for defining analytic accounting object.\\n===============================================\\n\\nIn Odoo, analytic accounts are linked to general accounts but are treated\\ntotally independently. So, you can enter various different analytic operations\\nthat have no counterpart in the general financial accounts.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nMódulo para definir el objeto de contabilidad analítica\\n===============================================\\n\\nEn Odoo, las cuentas analíticas están vinculadas a las cuentas generales, pero se tratan de\\nforma totalmente independiente. Por tanto, se pueden introducir varias operaciones\\nanalíticas diferentes que no tengan contrapartida en la contabilidad financiera general.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT account.analytic.account.list.select (list)\naccount.analytic.account.kanban (kanban)\naccount.analytic.account.list (list)\naccount.analytic.account.search (search)\naccount.analytic.distribution.model.form (form)\naccount.analytic.distribution.model.list (list)\naccount.analytic.line.form (form)\naccount.analytic.line.graph (graph)\naccount.analytic.line.kanban (kanban)\naccount.analytic.line.list (list)\naccount.analytic.line.pivot (pivot)\naccount.analytic.line.select (search)\naccount.analytic.plan.form (form)\naccount.analytic.plan.list (list)\nanalytic.analytic.account.form (form)	official	\N
