13	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "This module is used to send/receive responses to documents received/sent with PEPPOL"}	account_peppol_response	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Peppol Business Response"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nIn addition to the PEPPOL module, this enable the business level response mechanism for PEPPOL documents.\\nWhen sending a document, and if the counterpart also handles business responses, you will be able to\\nsee if your document has been accepted or rejected.\\nWhen receiving a document, you will be able to send a rejection or approval of the received document.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT account.peppol.response.view.move.form (form)\n* INHERIT res.partner.form.account.peppol.response (form)\naccount.peppol.rejection.wizard.view.form (form)\naccount.peppol.response.view.form (form)\naccount.peppol.response.view.list (list)	official	\N
20	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": ""}	api_doc	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "API Documentation"}	4	{"en_US": "\\nOdoo Dynamic API Documentation\\n==============================\\n\\nThis module provides a dynamic documentation page for developpers at the\\n/doc URL. The documentation is generated using the database to list the\\nmodels and their fields and methods. It also provides a playground to run\\nthe methods over HTTP, with examples in various programming languages.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			api_doc.docclient (qweb)	official	\N
4	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "Debit Notes", "es_ES": "Notas de débito"}	account_debit_note	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Debit Notes", "es_ES": "Notas de débito"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nIn a lot of countries, a debit note is used as an increase of the amounts of an existing invoice \\nor in some specific cases to cancel a credit note. \\nIt is like a regular invoice, but we need to keep track of the link with the original invoice.  \\nThe wizard used is similar as the one for the credit note.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEn muchos países, una nota de débito se utiliza para aumentar los importes de una factura existente\\no, en algunos casos específicos, para cancelar una factura rectificativa.\\nEs como una factura normal, pero debemos mantener el seguimiento del enlace con la factura original.\\nEl asistente utilizado es similar al de la factura rectificativa.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
16	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "Use python code to define taxes", "es_ES": "Use código Python para definir los impuestos"}	account_tax_python	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Define Taxes as Python Code", "es_ES": "Definir impuestos como código Python"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nA tax defined as python code consists of two snippets of python code which are executed in a local environment containing data such as the unit price, product or partner.\\n\\n\\"Applicable Code\\" defines if the tax is to be applied.\\n\\n\\"Python Code\\" defines the amount of the tax.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nUn impuesto definido como código Python consta de dos fragmentos de código Python que se ejecutan en un entorno local que contiene datos como el precio unitario, el producto o el asociado.\\n\\n\\"Código aplicable\\" define si se va a aplicar el impuesto.\\n\\n\\"Código Python\\" define el importe del impuesto.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
18	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1		{"en_US": "Allow updating tax grids on existing entries", "es_ES": "Permitir actualizar tablas de impuestos en asientos existentes"}	account_update_tax_tags	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Account - Allow updating tax grids", "es_ES": "Cuenta - permitir actualizar las tablas de impuestos"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nThis module allows updating tax grids on existing accounting entries.\\nIn debug mode a button to update your entries' tax grids will be available\\nin Accounting settings.\\nThis is typically useful after some legal changes were done on the tax report,\\nrequiring a new tax configuration.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste módulo permite actualizar las tablas de impuestos en asientos contables existentes.\\nEn el modo de depuración estará disponible un botón para actualizar las tablas de impuestos de asientos\\nen los ajustes de Contabilidad.\\nEsto es util después de que se realicen algunos cambios legales al informe de impuestos\\nen los que se necesite una nueva configuración de impuestos.|\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
