197	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1	https://www.odoo.com/documentation/latest/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations.html	{"en_US": ""}	l10n_fi	Avoin.Systems, Tawasta, Vizucom, Sprintit	/account/static/description/l10n.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Finland - Accounting"}	37	{"en_US": "\\nThis is the Odoo module to manage the accounting in Finland.\\n============================================================\\n\\nAfter installing this module, you'll have access to:\\n    * Finnish chart of account\\n    * Fiscal positions\\n    * Invoice Payment Reference Types (Finnish Standard Reference & Finnish Creditor Reference (RF))\\n    * Finnish Reference format for Sale Orders\\n\\nSet the payment reference type from the Sales Journal.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste es un módulo de Odoo para gestionar la contabilidad en Finlandia.\\n============================================================\\n\\nDespués de instalar este módulo tendrá acceso a:\\n    * Plan contable de Finlandia\\n    * Posiciones fiscales\\n    * Tipos de referencias de pago en las facturas (referencia estándar de Finlandia y referencia financiera de Finlandia (RF))\\n    * Formato de la referencia de Finlandia para pedidos de venta\\n\\nConfigure el tipo de referencia de pago del diario de ventas.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
