346	\N	\N	2026-11-25 09:29:52.923036	1	https://www.odoo.com/documentation/latest/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_kingdom.html	{"en_US": ""}	l10n_uk	SmartMode LTD	/account/static/description/l10n.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "United Kingdom - Accounting", "es_ES": "Reino Unido - Contabilidad"}	37	{"en_US": "\\nThis is the latest UK Odoo localisation necessary to run Odoo accounting for UK SME's with:\\n=================================================================================================\\n    - a CT600-ready chart of accounts\\n    - VAT100-ready tax structure\\n    - InfoLogic UK counties listing\\n    - a few other adaptations", "es_ES": "\\nEsta es la última localización de Odoo en Reino Unido, necesaria para dirigir la contabilidad de Odoo en las PYMEs mediante:\\n=================================================================================================\\n- un plan contable listo para usar con CT600\\n- estructura fiscal lista para usar con el formulario VAT100\\n- listado de las regiones inglesas en InfoLogic\\n- otras adaptaciones"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
