pe=\\"html_builder/composition/composition_square_3\\" data-format-mimetype=\\"image/webp\\" data-file-name=\\"s_text_image.svg\\" data-shape-colors=\\"o-color-2;;;;o-color-1\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_text_image pt80 pb80\\" data-snippet=\\"s_image_text\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row align-items-center\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-6 pt16 pb16\\">\\n                    <img src=\\"/html_editor/image_shape/website.s_image_text_default_image/html_builder/composition/composition_square_1.svg?c1=o-color-1&amp;c2=o-color-3\\" class=\\"img img-fluid mx-auto rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" data-shape=\\"html_builder/composition/composition_square_1\\" data-format-mimetype=\\"image/webp\\" data-file-name=\\"s_image_text.svg\\" data-shape-colors=\\"o-color-1;o-color-3;;;\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-5 offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16\\">\\n                    <h2 class=\\"h3-fs\\">Descubra nuevas <strong>experiencias</strong></h2>\\n                    <p>Escriba uno o dos párrafos que describan su café o cafetería. Para tener éxito, su contenido debe ser útil para sus lectores.</p>\\n                    <p>Comience con el cliente – descubra lo que desea y sírvaselo con esmero.</p>\\n                    <p><a href=\\"#\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary o_translate_inline\\">Ver menú</a></p>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_title pt40 pb40\\" data-vcss=\\"001\\" data-snippet=\\"s_title\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container s_allow_columns\\">\\n            <h2 class=\\"display-3-fs\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\">El título de tu sección</h2>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_company_team pt64 pb64\\" data-snippet=\\"s_company_team\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <h2 class=\\"h3-fs\\">Conoce a nuestro equipo</h2>\\n            <p class=\\"lead\\">Equipo apasionado que impulsa nuestra cafetería</p>\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-6 pt32 pb32\\" data-name=\\"Team Member\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"row s_col_no_resize s_col_no_bgcolor\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-3 pb24 o_not_editable\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\">\\n                            <img alt=\\"\\" src=\\"/html_editor/image_shape/website.s_company_team_image_1/html_builder/geometric/geo_square_1.svg\\" class=\\"img-fluid o_editable_media w-lg-100 mx-lg-auto\\" data-shape=\\"html_builder/geometric/geo_square_1\\" data-format-mimetype=\\"image/webp\\" data-file-name=\\"uiface_1.svg\\" data-shape-colors=\\";;;;\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-9\\">\\n                            <h3 class=\\"h5-fs\\">\\n        <font style=\\"background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--o-color-1) 0%, var(--o-color-5) 100%);\\" class=\\"text-gradient\\">Carlos Pérez</font></h3>\\n                            <p class=\\"text-muted mb-3\\">\\n        Barista jefe\\n    </p>\\n                            <p>\\n        María, fundadora y alma del proyecto, impulsa la cafetería con pasión por el café, la hospitalidad y las experiencias memorables para los clientes.\\n    </p>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-6 pt32 pb32\\" data-name=\\"Team Member\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"row s_col_no_resize s_col_no_bgcolor\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-3 pb24 o_not_editable\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\">\\n                            <img alt=\\"\\" src=\\"/html_editor/image_shape/website.s_company_team_image_2/html_builder/geometric/geo_square_2.svg\\" class=\\"img-fluid o_editable_media w-lg-100 mx-lg-auto\\" data-shape=\\"html_builder/geometric/geo_square_2\\" data-format-mimetype=\\"image/webp\\" data-file-name=\\"uiface_2.svg\\" data-shape-colors=\\";;;;\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-9\\">\\n                            <h3 class=\\"h5-fs\\">\\n        <font style=\\"background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--o-color-1) 0%, var(--o-color-5) 100%);\\" class=\\"text-gradient\\">Mich Stark</font> <br/></h3>\\n                            <p class=\\"text-muted mb-3\\">\\n        Barista creativo\\n    </p>\\n                            <p>\\n        Con pasión por el café, Mich aporta años de experiencia en comunicación para crear un espacio cercano, humano y lleno de historias que se disfrutan taza a taza.\\n    </p>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-6 pt32 pb32\\" data-name=\\"Team Member\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"row s_col_no_resize s_col_no_bgcolor\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-3 pb24 o_not_editable\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\">\\n                            <img alt=\\"\\" src=\\"/html_editor/image_shape/website.s_company_team_image_3/html_builder/geometric/geo_square_3.svg\\" class=\\"img-fluid o_editable_media w-lg-100 mx-lg-auto\\" data-shape=\\"html_builder/geometric/geo_square_3\\" data-format-mimetype=\\"image/webp\\" data-file-name=\\"uiface_3.svg\\" data-shape-colors=\\";;;;\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\"col-lg-9\\">\\n                            <h3 class=\\"h5-fs\\">\\n        <font style=\\"background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--o-color-2) 0%, var(--o-color-5) 100%);\\" class=\\"text-gradient\\">Carlos Vega</font></h3>\\n                            <p class=\\"text-muted mb-3\\">\\n        Barista y comunicadora\\n    </p>\\n                            <p>\\n        Lucía es una de esas personas que vive lo que hac